the target language is: prolog.

% The cases of fee.le, in a file of their own. fee.le gets them with
% "includes these scenarios:". This file includes the rules that it tests,
% so it can also be opened and run alone.

the knowledge base fee cases includes these resources:
    fee_rules.

the knowledge base fee cases includes:

scenario member is:
    alice is a member.
    alice buys concert.
    concert costs 40.
    who_pays expects answers ["alice pays 20.0 for concert"].

scenario visitor is:
    bob buys concert.
    concert costs 40.
    who_pays expects answers ["bob pays 40 for concert"].

query who_pays is:
    which person pays which amount for which ticket.
